+- `packages/frai-core/src/finetune/index.js` -- Export APPROVAL_STATUSES as named export after importing it from schema.js -- Makes the constant available to tests and external code
+- `packages/frai-core/src/eval/metrics.js` -- Wrap toxicityMetric in DEFAULT_METRICS to only pass outputs parameter -- Ensures correct metric signature and prevents references from being used as banned terms
